    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Hand-and-a-half sword with a straight double-fullered steel blade, a swept brass crossguard with swollen terminals, a ribbed leather-bound grip and a disc pommel set with a pale cabochon. The fuller runs the correct length down both faces, the blade tapers to a real point in the top view, and the grip ribbing and pommel gem are present on both sides. Free-standing weapon with no display furniture. Unrigged static prop.",
    "limitations": [
      "Stylised Cozy-kit palette rather than photoreal metal.",
      "Blade, guard and grip are one fused mesh and cannot be disassembled."
    ],
